  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You come from a proud family of ice fishers from Ten-Towns, in Icewind Dale. Catching knucklehead trout isn't the most glorious trade in the North, but it is honest work. You have trained your senses to feel the faintest tug on the line, hauled big trout out of frozen lakes, and gutted enough of them to feed your village many times over. That life has hardened your body and mind for adventure.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Dexterity, Constitution</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.feats24.Item.phbftAlert000000]{Alert}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Animal Handling and Athletics</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulWoodcarver]{Woodcarver's Tools}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulWoodcarver]{Woodcarver's Tools}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBasket00000]{Basket}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBlockandTac]{Block and Tackle}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBucket00000]{Bucket}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagChain000000]{Chain}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagHuntingTrap]{Hunting Trap}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagNet00000000]{Net}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPole0000000]{Pole}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRations0000]{Rations} (3 days' worth), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRope0000000]{Rope}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 32 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
